-9a04-5a20-a5d2-ec9135740a69"] ["question-fe6f82c7-c73d-5fb8-9cbc-ff242831dba6" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-15720162-78da-5cb1-b598-b8344581476a"] [17592186078531 :knowledge-point/questions "question-fe6f82c7-c73d-5fb8-9cbc-ff242831dba6"] ["question-47312f69-f326-5376-9041-14157a2dd5a5" :question/id #uuid "47312f69-f326-5376-9041-14157a2dd5a5"] ["question-47312f69-f326-5376-9041-14157a2dd5a5" :question/math-academy-id "q-103266"] ["question-47312f69-f326-5376-9041-14157a2dd5a5" :question/problem "![](images/4f/4f538bb715c53ad0478539feaef29c725f6f6e494134726faede38586e60a4d6.png)\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the angles shown above?\n\nI. $m∠AOB=m∠BOC$\n\nII. $m∠BOC=m∠COD$\n\nIII. $∠AOB≅∠DOE$"] ["question-47312f69-f326-5376-9041-14157a2dd5a5" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we see that \n\n- $∠AOB$ and $∠BOC$ are marked with $|$, and\n\n- $∠COD$ and $∠DOE$ are marked with $||.$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∠AOB & ≅∠BOC \\\\ ∠COD & ≅∠DOE.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConsequently, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠AOB & =m∠BOC \\\\ m∠COD & =m∠DOE.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo statement I is true, while statements II and III are false."] ["question-47312f69-f326-5376-9041-14157a2dd5a5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-6452e741-3219-5674-aa9c-11f468eb9f0b" :answer-field/id #uuid "6452e741-3219-5674-aa9c-11f468eb9f0b"] ["answer-71b862ff-f819-58ba-8500-e7a6c8b9b38e" :answer/id #uuid "71b862ff-f819-58ba-8500-e7a6c8b9b38e"] ["answer-71b862ff-f819-58ba-8500-e7a6c8b9b38e" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-71b862ff-f819-58ba-8500-e7a6c8b9b38e" :answer/value "I and II only"] ["answer-1d40922e-bbe8-5b94-813f-515ef8920c77" :answer/id #uuid "1d40922e-bbe8-5b94-813f-515ef8920c77"] ["answer-1d40922e-bbe8-5b94-813f-515ef8920c77" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-1d40922e-bbe8-5b94-813f-515ef8920c77" :answer/value "I only"] ["answer-99bd640f-26eb-57be-b433-3a9313b2d3bf" :answer/id #uuid "99bd640f-26eb-57be-b433-3a9313b2d3bf"] ["answer-99bd640f-26eb-57be-b433-3a9313b2d3bf" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-99bd640f-26eb-57be-b433-3a9313b2d3bf" :answer/value "II and III only"] ["answer-f212cd6f-41a2-599e-83ee-e2b7414a0f6a" :answer/id #uuid "f212cd6f-41a2-599e-83ee-e2b7414a0f6a"] ["answer-f212cd6f-41a2-599e-83ee-e2b7414a0f6a" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-f212cd6f-41a2-599e-83ee-e2b7414a0f6a" :answer/value "II only"] ["answer-46af0f5c-e63b-5c43-8a7a-63eca133b229" :answer/id #uuid "46af0f5c-e63b-5c43-8a7a-63eca133b229"] ["answer-46af0f5c-e63b-5c43-8a7a-63eca133b229" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-46af0f5c-e63b-5c43-8a7a-63eca133b229" :answer/value "III only"] ["answer-field-6452e741-3219-5674-aa9c-11f468eb9f0b" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-6452e741-3219-5674-aa9c-11f468eb9f0b" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-6452e741-3219-5674-aa9c-11f468eb9f0b" :answer-field/correct "answer-1d40922e-bbe8-5b94-813f-515ef8920c77"] ["answer-field-6452e741-3219-5674-aa9c-11f468eb9f0b" :answer-field/choices "answer-71b862ff-f819-58ba-8500-e7a6c8b9b38e"] ["answer-field-6452e741-3219-5674-aa9c-11f468eb9f0b" :answer-field/choices "answer-1d40922e-bbe8-5b94-813f-515ef8920c77"] ["answer-field-6452e741-3219-5674-aa9c-11f468eb9f0b" :answer-field/choices "answer-99bd640f-26eb-57be-b433-3a9313b2d3bf"] ["answer-field-6452e741-3219-5674-aa9c-11f468eb9f0b" :answer-field/choices "answer-f212cd6f-41a2-599e-83ee-e2b7414a0f6a"] ["answer-field-6452e741-3219-5674-aa9c-11f468eb9f0b" :answer-field/choices "answer-46af0f5c-e63b-5c43-8a7a-63eca133b229"] ["question-47312f69-f326-5376-9041-14157a2dd5a5" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-6452e741-3219-5674-aa9c-11f468eb9f0b"] [17592186176098 :knowledge-point/questions "question-47312f69-f326-5376-9041-14157a2dd5a5"] [17592186074001 :question/problem "$4\\sqrt{3}-5\\sqrt{12}=$"] [17592186074001 :question/worked-solution "First, we use the product rule for radicals, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{12} & =\\sqrt{4\\cdot 3}=\\sqrt{4}\\cdot \\sqrt{3}=2\\sqrt{3} & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4\\sqrt{3}-5\\sqrt{12} & = \\\\ 4\\sqrt{3}-5(2\\sqrt{3}) & = \\\\ 4\\sqrt{3}-10\\sqrt{3}. & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can combine the two $\\sqrt{3}$ terms together:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4\\sqrt{3}-10\\sqrt{3} & = \\\\ (4-10)\\sqrt{3} & = \\\\ -6\\sqrt{3} & \\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186074001 :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [17592186070091 :answer-field/correct 17592186070094] ["question-c20addaa-2ef3-5691-8ace-1f1d2895fe58" :question/id #uuid "c20addaa-2ef3-5691-8ace-1f1d2895fe58"] ["question-c20addaa-2ef3-5691-8ace-1f1d2895fe58" :question/math-academy-id "q-68963"] ["question-c20addaa-2ef3-5691-8ace-1f1d2895fe58" :question/problem "${({5}^{3}\\times 3)}^{4}=$"] ["question-c20addaa-2ef3-5691-8ace-1f1d2895fe58" :question/worked-solution "First, we apply the power of product rule for exponents:\n\n$$\n{({5}^{3}\\times 3)}^{4}={({5}^{3})}^{4}\\times {3}^{4}\n$$\n\nThen, we rewrite the first factor using the power rule for exponents, and simplify:\n\n$$\n{({5}^{3})}^{4}\\times {3}^{4}={5}^{3\\cdot 4}\\times {3}^{4}={5}^{12}\\times {3}^{4}\n$$"] ["question-c20addaa-2ef3-5691-8ace-1f1d2895fe58" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-8bd771f8-1da2-5ff5-b018-e0a61817e437" :answer-field/id #uuid "8bd771f8-1da2-5ff5-b018-e0a61817e437"] ["answer-7612e3e8-6c41-58cd-b9cd-de345315c958" :answer/id #uuid "7612e3e8-6c41-58cd-b9cd-de345315c958"] ["answer-7612e3e8-6c41-58cd-b9cd-de345315c958" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-7612e3e8-6c41-58cd-b9cd-de345315c958" :answer/value "{5}^{10}\\times {3}^{6}"] ["answer-505fc778-325e-5f2c-b027-1e6623d55f37" :answer/id #uuid "505fc778-325e-5f2c-b027-1e6623d55f37"] ["answer-505fc778-325e-5f2c-b027-1e6623d55f37" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-505fc778-325e-5f2c-b027-1e6623d55f37" :answer/value "{5}^{12}\\times {3}^{4}"] ["answer-f8652722-ecb3-51f0-bc15-77dae7eb9a77" :answer/id #uuid "f8652722-ecb3-51f0-bc15-77dae7eb9a77"] ["answer-f8652722-ecb3-51f0-bc15-77dae7eb9a77" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-f8652722-ecb3-51f0-bc15-77dae7eb9a77" :answer/value "{5}^{12}\\times {3}^{8}"] ["answer-e38221f4-6a33-5206-9b11-ccf256f3aa86" :answer/id #uuid "e38221f4-6a33-5206-9b11-ccf256f3aa86"] ["answer-e38221f4-6a33-5206-9b11-ccf256f3aa86" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e38221f4-6a33-5206-9b11-ccf256f3aa86" :answer/value "{5}^{3}\\times {3}^{8}"] ["answer-0ac94868-df19-5ec5-bcd2-c6a2c7a548b7" :answer/id #uuid "0ac94868-df19-5ec5-bcd2-c6a2c7a548b7"] ["answer-0ac94868-df19-5ec5-bcd2-c6a2c7a548b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-0ac94868-df19-5ec5-bcd2-c6a2c7a548b7" :answer/value "{5}^{7}\\times {3}^{4}"] ["answer-field-8bd771f8-1da2-5ff5-b018-e0a61817e437" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-8bd771f8-1da2-5ff5-b018-e0a61817e437" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-8bd771f8-1da2-5ff5-b018-e0a61817e437" :answer-field/correct "answer-505fc778-325e-5f2c-b027-1e6623d55f37"] ["answer-field-8bd771f8-1da2-5ff5-b018-e0a61817e437" :answer-field/choices "answer-7612e3e8-6c41-58cd-b9cd-de345315c958"] ["answer-field-8bd771f8-1da2-5ff5-b018-e0a61817e437" :answer-field/choices "answer-505fc778-325e-5f2c-b027-1e6623d55f37"] ["answer-field-8bd771f8-1da2-5ff5-b018-e0a61817e437" :answer-field/choices "answer-f8652722-ecb3-51f0-bc15-77dae7eb9a77"] ["answer-field-8bd771f8-1da2-5ff5-b018-e0a61817e437" :answer-field/choices "answer-e38221f4-6a33-5206-9b11-ccf256f3aa86"] ["answer-field-8bd771f8-1da2-5ff5-b018-e0a61817e437" :answer-field/choices "answer-0ac94868-df19-5ec5-bcd2-c6a2c7a548b7"] ["question-c20addaa-2ef3-5691-8ace-1f1d2895fe58" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-8bd771f8-1da2-5ff5-b018-e0a61817e437"] [17592186110617 :knowledge-point/questions "question-c20addaa-2ef3-5691-8ace-1f1d2895fe58"] ["question-2c796978-9336-5fc7-a4cc-bd1fe1ccd4cd" :question/id #uuid "2c796978-9336-5fc7-a4cc-bd1fe1ccd4cd"] ["question-2c796978-9336-5fc7-a4cc-bd1fe1ccd4cd" :question/math-academy-id "q-215096"] ["question-2c796978-9336-5fc7-a4cc-bd1fe1ccd4cd" :question/problem "If $v=2τdh,$ then $τ=${{field-1}}."] ["question-2c796978-9336-5fc7-a4cc-bd1fe1ccd4cd" :question/worked-solution "We need to isolate $τ,$ so we will treat the other variables $v,d,$ and $h$ as constants. We can use the multiplication principle to solve for $τ.$\n\nFirst, we rearrange and then divide both sides by $2dh:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & =2τdh \\\\ v & =(2dh)τ \\\\ \\frac{v}{2dh} & =\\frac{(2dh)τ}{2dh} \\\\ \\frac{v}{2dh} & =τ\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $τ=\\frac{v}{2dh}.$\n\n**Note:** This result assumes that $d\\ne 0$ and $h\\ne 0.$"] ["question-2c796978-9336-5fc7-a4cc-bd1fe1ccd4cd" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-066b2166-822f-5d65-8ee3-2f1f64ae2d7d" :answer-field/id #uuid "066b2166-822f-5d65-8ee3-2f1f64ae2d7d"] ["answer-71a54dfc-a7bc-50b1-888f-91e3d09fe8d3" :answer/id #uuid "71a54dfc-a7bc-50b1-888f-91e3d09fe8d3"] ["answer-71a54dfc-a7bc-50b1-888f-91e3d09fe8d3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-71a54dfc-a7bc-50b1-888f-91e3d09fe8d3" :answer/value "\\frac{v}{2dh}"] ["answer-field-066b2166-822f-5d65-8ee3-2f1f64ae2d7d" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-066b2166-822f-5d65-8ee3-2f1f64ae2d7d" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-066b2166-822f-5d65-8ee3-2f1f64ae2d7d" :answer-field/correct "answer-71a54dfc-a7bc-50b1-888f-91e3d09fe8d3"] ["answer-field-066b2166-822f-5d65-8ee3-2f1f64ae2d7d" :answer-field/choices "answer-71a54dfc-a7bc-50b1-888f-91e3d09fe8d3"] ["question-2c796978-9336-5fc7-a4cc-bd1fe1ccd4cd" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-066b2166-822f-5d65-8ee3-2f1f64ae2d7d"] [17592186064194 :knowledge-point/questions "question-2c796978-9336-5fc7-a4cc-bd1fe1ccd4cd"] ["question-d9b9c93d-9a95-57ab-bfc8-b62b1c153ff8" :question/id #uuid "d9b9c93d-9a95-57ab-bfc8-b62b1c153ff8"] ["question-d9b9c93d-9a95-57ab-bfc8-b62b1c153ff8" :question/math-academy-id "q-63877"] ["question-d9b9c93d-9a95-57ab-bfc8-b62b1c153ff8" :question/problem "Evaluate $\\sqrt[3]{5y+1}$ at $y=3.$"] ["question-d9b9c93d-9a95-57ab-bfc8-b62b1c153ff8" :question/worked-solution "We replace $y$ with $3$ in the given expression, and simplify as much as possible:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[3]{5y+1} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{5\\cdot 3+1} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{15+1} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{16} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{8\\cdot 2} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{8}\\cdot \\sqrt[3]{2} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{{2}^{3}}\\cdot \\sqrt[3]{2} & = \\\\ 2\\sqrt[3]{2} & \\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-d9b9c93d-9a95-57ab-bfc8-b62b1c153ff8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-b9a3fd1a-2273-5c72-90b6-7e74178421d4" :answer-field/id #uuid "b9a3fd1a-2273-5c72-90b6-7e74178421d4"] ["answer-3af63541-1762-58f0-a991-4c6b26b43531" :answer/id #uuid "3af63541-1762-58f0-a991-4c6b26b43531"] ["answer-3af63541-1762-58f0-a991-4c6b26b43531" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-3af63541-1762-58f0-a991-4c6b26b43531" :answer/value "2\\sqrt[3]{2}"] ["answer-b93ea9d0-8b76-54b8-8b51-d66c68f7b7fd" :answer/id #uuid "b93ea9d0-8b76-54b8-8b51-d66c68f7b7fd"] ["answer-b93ea9d0-8b76-54b8-8b51-d66c68f7b7fd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b93ea9d0-8b76-54b8-8b51-d66c68f7b7fd" :answer/value "3"] ["answer-bba12de4-ce73-58e0-91af-1d1824b8de14" :answer/id #uuid "bba12de4-ce73-58e0-91af-1d1824b8de14"] ["answer-bba12de4-ce73-58e0-91af-1d1824b8de14" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-bba12de4-ce73-58e0-91af-1d1824b8de14" :answer/value "4"] ["answer-27fdf04b-368f-516d-9e0e-8cca33d47e26" :answer/id #uuid "27fdf04b-368f-516d-9e0e-8cca33d47e26"] ["answer-27fdf04b-368f-516d-9e0e-8cca33d47e26" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-27fdf04b-368f-516d-9e0e-8cca33d47e26" :answer/value "4\\sqrt[3]{3}"] ["answer-69a0d827-e260-5878-81a5-f3ff4aab7335" :answer/id #uuid "69a0d827-e260-5878-81a5-f3ff4aab7335"] ["answer-69a0d827-e260-5878-81a5-f3ff4aab733